  "_": [
    "What the Dream Fountains sell and the Dream Favours give: the rewards of the client's",
    "InfiniteDreamRewardsDataRoot that the shop window shows (f10), with what each one is worth.",
    "",
    "The client's reward rows name WHICH effects a reward carries -- 65 'Aguante' is one 2844 and",
    "one 2971 -- but not how much, nor its price, rarity or icon: those come with the server's",
    "offer. So they are written here, from the dofuspourlesnoobs guide 'Songes infinis' (its",
    "fontaineOnirique table: kind, rarity, price; and each line's effects), and checked against",
    "the five offers of the long capture's fountain -- 65, 149, 103, 89 and 124 -- byte for byte.",
    "",
    "rewards: by the client's reward id.",
    "  kind       active (a dream spell, the effect 3405 of its grade 1), passive (a dream passive,",
    "             the effect 792 of its spell), bonus or consumable.",
    "  rarity     the f7: 0 common, 1 rare, 2 epic, 3 legendary (the guide's Commun..Légendaire).",
    "  spell      the client's spell of an active or a passive. Its icon is the spell's own IconId",
    "             (15389 for Psst Psst and 15382 for Arenero, as captured) and its level is grade 1",
    "             (85231 and 83685, as captured).",
    "  icon       the f9 of anything else. Measured: 14798, 14799, 14813 (the captured offers) and",
    "             the rooms' 14797, 14804, 14850, 14895, 14931, 15026, 14811. iconInferred: picked off",
    "             the client's Picto sheet by what it draws (a shield for Armure, a fist for",
    "             Belliciste...); no capture shows them.",
    "  bonuses    [effect, value] in the order of the reward row's actions (the captured Aguante",
    "             carries 2971 before 2844: actions 5 and 13); [effect, value, true] for the",
    "             nested ones, the f6 { f1: value } of a spell or weapon modifier.",
    "  sand, storms, levels, points   what the reward row's other actions add up to: 17 a sand,",
    "             38 a storm, 156 fifty dreamer levels, 14 a dream point.",
    "  unique     'Ne peut être obtenu qu'une seule fois par songe' in the guide.",
    "  special    what a passive does that its spell does not: Viento a Favor and Suelta are",
    "             effect 666 alone, and the reward row carries one more action the effects table",
    "             lacks (214, 226). alliesPlayFirst: 'Garantiza que el equipo aliado tome la",
    "             iniciativa del combate'; placeAnywhere: 'Autoriza a cada luchador aliado a",
    "             colocarse en cualquier casilla durante la fase de preparación'.",
    "",
    "fountain: reward -> price, in the guide's order. 'Dans la première Fontaine Onirique",
    "  (profondeur 4), vous ne pouvez croiser que des bonus qui coûtent 15 points de rêve",
    "  maximum', and of the passives only 'Vent Arrière' (firstFountainPassives).",
    "favour: the guide's 'liste de toutes les Faveurs obtenables', free; favourPurse is always",
    "  the third choice: 'une petite bourse de 10 Points de rêve'."
  ],
